### E-WIN Banner Integration
The banner appears **between the topbar and hero** on the homepage, styled with:
- Full-bleed layout using negative margin technique
- Orange-to-green gradient background matching brand palette
- Schema.org `itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Organization"` binding PulseOdds to E-WIN as parent org
- `itemprop="memberOf"` link to ewinproject.org — signals parent org to Google Knowledge Graph
- Pulsing orange dot animation (matches app brand)
- `itemprop="founder"` footer link to author page for E-E-A-T

### Footer Enhancement
The footer now includes `itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Organization"` with:
- `itemprop="legalName"` on brand name
- `itemprop="memberOf"` E-WIN link
- `itemprop="founder"` author attribution link

